Gilligan and Gilligan is a magic item showroom and shop operated by two [[Bestiary/Rule of Beasts#Ysoki|Ysoki]] (Gilligan and Gilligan, respectively). While the goods they offer are varied, the pair are famously judgmental about their clientele and will only sell to those who they think deserve it.
